{"server":"tw","storyId":"act16side_level_act16side_st02","groupId":"act16side","stageId":"act16side_st02","title":"鳶尾花","storyCode":"GA-ST-2","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16side/level_act16side_st02.txt","sourceHash":"1458aac580edf825c2c4a66f262a85dc84fe776aae09b0ef287832db601a590d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g9_laterano_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我都要把這次來拉特蘭當成一次度假了......沒想到會發生這樣的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤卡坦，謝拉格也是有信仰的小國......為什麼拉特蘭可以這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭的影響力實在廣泛得多......萬國信使也是拉特蘭教宗佈局已久的安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝拉格沒有這樣的基礎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......影響力，影響力，走出謝拉格才發現，影響力真是個麻煩的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在想想，也真虧恩希歐迪斯過去只靠自己在幾個鄰國間周旋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今，聖女大人的影響力也在逐步提升......我們有我們的優勢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......可你覺得，拉特蘭教宗說的那些，真能實現嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我無法想像，各個國家保持更加緊密的聯繫，這片大地會是什麼樣子......這聽起來像一個夢。也不知道是不是好夢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是那天的神跡......還有教宗的演講，沒有人能等閒視之。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭，果真是被眷顧之城......嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾澤爾小哥，你們薩科塔怎麼看這段時間的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊......是，很大的衝擊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想也是，聽人說那口鐘幾千年沒響過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭會怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也許不會怎麼樣，以我對拉特蘭人的瞭解......不，也許哪裡都是一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使發生了後世歷史中舉足輕重的大事......在當時當地，大家也許，都沒什麼實感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們總會意識到變化正在發生，承擔起屬於自己的責任與使命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你還蠻有擔當的嘛，小哥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，就送到這裡吧，接我們的車會開到這裡來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事。薇爾麗芙樞機就在附近的醫院，我直接去向她覆命，很方便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，說到那位樞機，替我向她道謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“您滿意就好”——樞機是這麼吩咐的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是滴水不漏......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，小哥，幫我和我丈夫拍張照吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣就可以了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"攝影技術也不錯，艾澤爾小哥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩位不客氣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲亞梅塔，你有沒有覺得自己的腳步特別沉重？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教宗閣下講了那樣的話，你難道沒有感受到肩上的重擔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我在認真考慮是不是該換一份工作了，太需要責任感的工作不太適合我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你接替我就很合適。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做夢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩位，下午好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾澤爾小哥，好久不見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就不到兩周啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......在執行任務？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇爾麗芙樞機安排了一點事情，我正要去向她覆命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我在拉特蘭城的最後一項任務了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯嘛，小哥，出去看過了就知道，拉特蘭城蠻無聊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然外面沒有那麼多好吃的甜點，不過，我們生活的意義也不只是享受，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要去找薇爾麗芙？她現在在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司提望區中心醫院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，艾澤爾小哥，我們同路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g7_laterano_ward"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你決定了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我決定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為你還要猶豫一段時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼......只是覺得，大家都邁出了下一步，我也不能再原地踏步了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就不多問了。你能答應，我已經很高興了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在這種時候，有你這樣的人才加入，再好不過。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就猜到你會在這裡，薇爾麗芙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們怎麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們半路遇到了艾澤爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝拉格的兩位使者已經送達目的地了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別急著走，我來這裡還有別的事，你跟我一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，蕾繆安，下周見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下周見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"決定去七廳了嗎，蕾繆安？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經在做事了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......會議之後，去七廳會很辛苦吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不覺得七廳很適合我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是倒是啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們都走上了自己的路，我也該想想我能做的事啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛才還在和菲亞梅塔說，想辭了萬國信使的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怕麻煩了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那老傢伙......我已經看到麻煩越來越多的未來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑不掉的哦，莫斯提馬。你要歸我直管了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先幫我個小忙，把這封信帶去給小樂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......能拒絕嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且你必須親手交給她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更想辭職了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別說敷衍自己的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好嚴格啊，菲亞梅塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不會放棄的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼肯定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別裝得像你不需要這份工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也在找答案，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不是安多恩......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒說你是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你還要選，對嗎，關於你到底是誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要回答這樣的問題......每個人都得走過足夠長的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，莫斯提馬，被理解的感覺怎麼樣？看來不需要光環也能理解你哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那這就是我自己的路。你不該跟著我，菲亞梅塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少自大了，誰跟著你？只是恰好同路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的銃在我手上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他真的還認為自己是一個薩科塔，他會來取回這把銃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到了那個時候，我會讓他為自己做的事付出代價......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要做我的幫手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說到這個，之前在城裡抓到的迷途者，已經全部釋放了哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是教宗閣下的意思嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教宗閣下的仁慈和我沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是菲亞梅塔的風格啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，之後會讓你走五廳的流程，用公證所的協定掛靠到羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，莫斯提馬和蕾繆樂兼職的那家醫藥公司......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇爾麗芙希望和那家公司加深合作，你作為人選就很合適啊~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，就我所知，我們和那家公司的合作記錄相當不錯，應該能給你提供不少支援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後然後，菲亞梅塔，還有一個超級好消息要告訴你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，你竟然可以從三~個代號裡！選一個，成為你下次的任務代號哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......說實在的，既然現在是你和我們對接，這個規則真的不能取消嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是因為當時沒有明確的監視這傢伙的職位，才臨時起了個名字......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經受夠每個月都會變一次的職位名了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"微光守夜人你不是挺喜歡的嗎，還說上面的品味總算變好了一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你給我閉嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這朵花真好看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話是這樣說......可事到如今，你職位名字的變化也已經成了一種規則了，就認命吧~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“虛空美食家”，“曠野飛行員”，“黎明破壞者”，選一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“黎明破壞者”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，菲亞梅塔，你的品味挺好懂的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你給我閉嘴！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g7_laterano_ward"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醒了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......感覺我最近真的很倒楣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，嫌躺著不舒服？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會，當我沒說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？艾澤爾小哥也在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我讓他來看看，差點背叛拉特蘭的人會有什麼下場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼敲打年輕人也太過分了，薇爾麗芙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是年輕人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不再是萬國信使了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這就是代價......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你仍然是我的部下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那這代價還不小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你向我誇下了海口，奧倫。那就讓我看看，你在維多利亞都學到了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我是否可以認為，你需要我以我的方式行事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，我可以回答你之前那個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧倫，我對於成為一個高尚的人沒有興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我並不討厭為了高尚的人而付出努力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......我倒也不反對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些話也是說給我聽的嗎，樞機？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"珍惜你和塞茜莉亞得到的機會。別讓我知道，她會對拉特蘭......有什麼影響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......不希望塞茜莉亞再回到拉特蘭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我那麼希望，為什麼要花時間給那個孩子造一個戶籍呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了，啊，同情。更重要的當然是......她還有別樣的價值，我願意為這種價值而承擔風險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，小哥，獲得這種坦率的承諾對你只有好處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用緊張。我只是在向你展現屬於拉特蘭的誠意，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若你和塞茜莉亞何時厭倦了旅行......你們還可以回到拉特蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭會給你們留一扇門。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請進。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科前輩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"樞機薇爾麗芙，這是前萬國信使奧倫·亞吉奧拉斯近兩年的出行記錄報告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦你了，執行者費德里科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以防萬一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"根據已有情報，推測執行者里凱萊可能是他的共犯，需要傳訊里凱萊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。他一定會說自己“被老同學蒙在鼓裡”，對吧，奧倫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可怕的女人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會追究里凱萊......暫時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，之後我希望透過你和他聊一聊，沒問題吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，完全沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目前對此二人的處置就是這樣，執行者費德里科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，費德里科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我後來想到一件事。你從一本筆記的寥寥數語，要摸清那個和薩卡茲見面的女人是費莉亞，這不是件容易的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼那麼執著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在找的究竟是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿爾圖羅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾圖羅......嗯？阿爾圖羅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是那個通緝犯阿爾圖羅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......費德里科，你和阿爾圖羅是什麼關係？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"她是我的遠親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈，哈哈哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說實在的，費德里科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是我現在站都站不穩，我真的想拉你去喝個酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會有的。因為我恰好在幾年前......真的見到過那位比安多恩名氣還要大得多的通緝犯，阿爾圖羅小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冷靜！冷靜！薇爾麗芙！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是主動找上阿爾圖羅！只是正好碰上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，我自認算見多識廣，但那段經歷，即使是我也感到毛骨悚然......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"你在哪裡見到她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三年前，在萊塔尼亞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g5_laterano_chapelout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾澤爾哥哥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里凱萊前輩......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各種手續都辦好了，她現在可以自由離開拉特蘭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，里凱萊前輩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道自己接下來該去哪吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我們先去和費德里科前輩會合，去一家叫做羅德島的公司掛靠一個合作協定。畢竟要在外面待很久......據說這樣會方便很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你記得就好，招呼我已經打過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你仍然是公證所的執行者。不方便回來的時候，任務也會透過羅德島發給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有預感，你和小塞茜莉亞的旅途會很順利，說不定很快就能找到要找的人哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的預感一向很準。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就先走了，再見，小塞茜莉亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再見，里凱萊哥哥。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿嚏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......怎麼忽然有種要倒楣的預感。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里凱萊前輩也相當有個性啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，等等，他怎麼知道我們在找......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾澤爾哥哥，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，塞茜莉亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還想......說點什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"女孩鬆開了年輕薩科塔的手，走入花田中央。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我要離開拉特蘭了，媽媽。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（但不是逃走。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我會自己去找爸爸，會把你的話帶給他。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我要用自己的眼睛看外面的世界......我要去找卡茲戴爾。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（媽媽，我很幸福。過去、現在......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（請看著我。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"修士姐姐，我可以摘一朵白色的花嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_369_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以的，小妹妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亞要帶走這朵花嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鮮花可能保存不了太久......我幫你做成標本吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，請教教我，我也想學會自己做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，艾澤爾哥哥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亞，該說謝謝的是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦......那是......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g5_laterano_chapelout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕蒂亞，你真的要和我一起走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我覺得，說不定你可以留在拉特蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭沒有我的目標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，帕蒂亞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，沒什麼，是我冒昧了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......您......您是在笑嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不是說您平時......但好像，不太一樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長久以來，我以為我們於荒野中踽踽獨行......這是我的不成熟和自以為是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕蒂亞，那天，你聽到那位老人的演講了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......醒過來的時候，剛好聽到後面一半，全城的廣播都在放......很吵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊萬傑利斯塔，擁有犧牲與團結美德的聖徒......也許，他比之前使用這個名字的十人，走得更遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是宏大又易碎的願景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我願奉上祝福......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那天，您到底知曉了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不重要了，帕蒂亞，不那麼重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使道路的盡頭沒有獎賞，前行本身就是舉火。我亦當向前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們所做的一切，不為交易恩賜，不為換取垂憐，我們依仗自己堅信的事物行路，是因為......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是唯一有尊嚴的生活。不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_364_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先導，我們該出發了，得趕在太陽落山之前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，兄弟姐妹們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亞，你在看什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，什麼都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"落日真美呀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_279_excu","aliases":["費德里科"]}]}
